# Difference Between API and Web Scraping

| API                       | Web Scraping                   |
| ------------------------- | ------------------------------ |
| Data comes in JSON format | Data comes in HTML format      |
| Official way to get data  | Reads webpage HTML             |
| Faster                    | Slightly slower                |
| Easier                    | More complex                   |
| Stable                    | Website changes can break code |

---

# When to Use API?

Use an API if:

* The website provides an official API.
* Data is available in JSON format.
* Authentication is available.

---

# When to Use Web Scraping?

Use Web Scraping if:

* No API is available.
* Data is only visible on the website.
* The website allows scraping according to its Terms of Service and robots.txt.

